  "bio": "Welcome to Red Dragon Tattoo Parlour, an avant-garde studio nestled in the heart of Toronto that champions artistic expression and inclusivity. Our all-female team of artists specializes in unique illustrative designs, using exclusively vegan inks to create your perfect body art in a queer-friendly environment. Step into a realm where creativity thrives, and your individuality is celebrated with every meticulous and vibrant piece crafted.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location:\n\nAll female artists\nQueer friendly 🏳️‍🌈 🏳️‍⚧️\nWalk-ins and Appointments \nVegan ink\nLink below to book\n\nAll female artists\nQueer friendly 🏳️‍🌈 🏳️‍⚧️\nWalk-ins and Appointments \nVegan ink\nLink below to book",
